en step as well as in the description — not only in the description. Every Given/When/Then step uses the exact role from the story's `as_a` field, \\\"Calculator User\\\". Given steps stay exactly as they are (they already instance the `document selected` concept). When steps stay exactly as they are (they already instance the `view requested` concept). Only the Then step and the description change, so each Then step instances the `then` concept `summary length` (means: the displayed summary contains at most a stated number of words) by naming the number, 150.\\n\\n### Change #1: 001-brief\\n**Before:** The viewer must display a concise summary when the Calculator User requests the brief view.\\n**Issue:** \\\"concise\\\" is not measurable — nothing in the AC states a verifiable limit, so the Then step \\\"the summary is concise\\\" cannot be asserted in a test.\\n**After (description):** The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the brief view.\\n**After (steps):**\\n```yaml\\n- given:\\n    - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n- when:\\n    - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"brief\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n- then:\\n    - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\n### Change #2: 002-overview\\n**Before:** The viewer must display a concise summary when the Calculator User requests the overview view.\\n**Issue:** \\\"concise\\\" is not measurable — the Then step \\\"the summary is concise\\\" states no verifiable threshold.\\n**After (description):** The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the overview view.\\n**After (steps):**\\n```yaml\\n- given:\\n    - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n- when:\\n    - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"overview\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n- then:\\n    - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\n### Change #3: 003-preview\\n**Before:** The viewer must display a concise summary when the Calculator User requests the preview view.\\n**Issue:** \\\"concise\\\" is not measurable — the Then step \\\"the summary is concise\\\" states no verifiable threshold.\\n**After (description):** The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the preview view.\\n**After (steps):**\\n```yaml\\n- given:\\n    - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n- when:\\n    - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"preview\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n- then:\\n    - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\nNo new ACs are added. Edge cases that would need new criteria (missing or unreadable document, exit codes, response-time budgets) are not specified by the product document and must not be invented here — see Open Questions below.\\n\\n## Complete Fixed Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n```yaml\\nacceptance_criteria:\\n  - id: 001-brief\\n    description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the brief view.\\\"\\n    steps:\\n      - given:\\n          - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n      - when:\\n          - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"brief\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n      - then:\\n          - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n\\n  - id: 002-overview\\n    description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the overview view.\\\"\\n    steps:\\n      - given:\\n          - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n      - when:\\n          - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"overview\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n      - then:\\n          - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n\\n  - id: 003-preview\\n    description: \\\"The viewer must display a summary of at most 150 words when the Calculator User requests the preview view.\\\"\\n    steps:\\n      - given:\\n          - \\\"a shared document is selected\\\"\\n      - when:\\n          - \\\"the Calculator User requests the \\\\\\\"preview\\\\\\\" view\\\"\\n      - then:\\n          - \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n```\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nAfter this change every AC names an explicit, assertable threshold:\\n- 001-brief: measurable — \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n- 002-overview: measurable — \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n- 003-preview: measurable — \\\"the displayed summary contains at most 150 words\\\"\\n- Totals: 3/3 = 100% (above the 50% threshold)\\n\\n## Open Questions for the Product Owner (do not invent values)\\n\\nAsk rather than guess if any of the following is wanted but unspecified:\\n- a minimum word count, or a per-view limit different from 150 (the product document says all three views enforce the same limit and that \\\"No other thresholds are specified\\\")\\n- a response-time budget in milliseconds for rendering a view\\n- an exit code or exact error message when the document is missing or unreadable\\n- the exact stdout field or formatting the word count is measured over (the architecture says only \\\"stdout contains the summary\\\")\\n\", \"questions\": []}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":923,"cache_read_input_tokens":18109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":923},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"110f875a-9a84-4b1a-bb6f-63e8168a360e","uuid":"4d6419f6-0b1d-47e0-95cc-1b69919fba6c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T21:20:24.092Z","request_id":"req_011CgZ7wjW33MQUaBxQcxd15"}
